<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Onobasulu translation committee - 2016</book>
  <para style="h">Filemono</para>
  <para style="rem">Draft by Onobasulu Translation team March 2016</para>
  <para style="rem">Revised Johann Alberts April 2016</para>
  <para style="rem">Advisor Check, Onobasulu Translation Team in Ukarumpa, 1-2 October 2020, Anne Stoppels present via Zoom.</para>
  <para style="rem">Consultant Check in April and May 2022. Elly van Bodegraven consultant via Zoom from the Netherlands. Freshly and Yugu, Yobe and Daiyaleme in Ukarumpa with Beverly. Anne also present via Zoom.</para>
  <para style="rem">Corrections after CC put in with Wabele and Osa, March 2023</para>
  <para style="toc1">Folohe Filemonofea Sowi Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filemono</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flm</para>
  <para style="mt">Filemono</para>
  <para style="mt2">Folohe Filemonofea</para>
  <para style="mt2">Sowi Ewe Selefia Mebailu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Folo asulu fogomo, Kolosi dauno ami, inolo bule ulenomo asulu. Ene wimo, Filemono. Bisigiamo, Kolosi dauno amone keliso alolu ulenomo, e. Ene balu dabalu mololo faibili aleba ami, uleno ene wimo, Onesimusu. Balu dabalu mololo faibe Onesimusu amo ehe, ene biso Filemono afasia, e dauno no fisaba maiyo daalu. Aufia, dauno no amimo, ehe Folo wakalilu. Aufia, Folohe efea awalu sulu nafulu walesi, e keliso inolo ami alolu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Fogo amoyamo, Folo e aso dibolo ligia, e malabiyosia kaafia alolu. Aulune, ene e Filemono babiyo maiyodoluale alolu. Auluso, ehe sowi ewe selefasia, Onesimusune sone saabia ofelesia, ehe e-mo ene biso labea obegeba malalu. Sowi ewene usu amimo, Folohe Filemonofea selesia, e koleba, ene balu dabalu mololo faibefea gadimabiyolu. Aga balu dabalu mololo faibe amo, keliso inolo adesimo, Filemono ga koleba, e-mo ge gelewogulu uluba dimale. Folohe Filemonofea auba seleba melu.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Na <char style="w">Folo</char>, Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> wi alefasia, dibolo dafogolu alebaibumone, ulenomo, na. Nada, nine nelewo <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodida</char>, anihe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PHM 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Sowi ewe, Filemono gafea seleba mebaisu. Ga koleba, nine yaguso seale alefasia, nini galiba dabalu ua mololo labe. <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:17">Kol 4.17</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 2:3">2Dim 2.3</ref></char></note>Sowi ewemo, anine nano, Afiadai, ninifaba ua yobolo, Alikifusudai, aaluda alegamesi memale.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bisigiamo, ido </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Afia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo, Filemonone eamono alolubu. Aufia, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Alikifusu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo, e Filemonone faibe alolubu.</char></note> Aufia, <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolo sunia ge moloa gagaiyoba adaaba ado ili amoda sowi ewe alegamesi memale.<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Nine Nao Godedai, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu Kelisodaihe, gili kanuluba ofelesia, gine libo esebalo gadaeaba melesi moloyobafe.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filemonone mana nafuluhe Folo e heneba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Na ne <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selesiamo</char>, nahe ga asigi gagabasu ligia, Efea henelu sulu selabasu ado. <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />Mau enebamo, fogo sunia ilihe nafea selesi dobelesiamo, ewegubasu sodo. Ga alefasia, Saminilo Yesufea hameseba ligia, Efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule seale ufulubiyo</char>. Aufia, gahe <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene idele inolo</char> suniafea hameseba adoba selesi dubulu.<verse eid="PHM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Na ga hilisesia, Godedai sulu selesiamo, na eweguba selesu. Ga sigidubulu noolodai dafifia ligia, ga asigi ule ufulufealomo fefedelu melesi hamefeba selesu. Auba ausi, ga kegele nafulu sunia fadaba dawalosia, Kelisodai kulifia miliyobafe. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 7:4">2Kld 7.4</ref></char></note>Ne nelewo, ga koleba, Godene idele inolo suniafea hameselone, mana ewe alefasia, gahe ine libo kiwigaaba ufuluso. Ga auba mololumo alefasia, ne henelo wasigasia, ne asigine libomo esebalo gadaeaba ofogofia koleba lolu.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Onesimusu sagoba homesi, Folohe Filemonofea solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Aulugulu, ne nelewo, ga doma. Ga moloyomo, no dobu. Na-mo, Yesu Kelisone wi alefasia, gafea molomaleba egedidiba saeyone wida lolu. Auluso, na gafea amoguba egedidiyale. <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />Aubale. Na Yesu Kelisone dibolo inolo hagolu widale ligia, nahe hameselo manane maufea alefasia, aga gafea molomaleyobileba susiba doba bosolu.<verse eid="PHM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 4:9">Kol 4.9</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 4:15">1Kld 4.15</ref></char>
    </note>Na gafea molomesi doba bosolumo, ne faibe Onesimusu ewene selesu. Na dibolo lolu fogo ewe, Onesimusu e na labea goasi, nahe e Kelisofea asigi ule homesine sagoba ufulu. Aulune, na selesumo, e-mo, ne faibe seale koleba holobagaso. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Saminimo, e aso ge dabalu balu moloba ligia, e ge si saabia eleda male alolubiyo. Auluso, aga e gafeada, nafeada eleda holobagafia labeo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giligi suluba selesiamo, Onesimusu, amone wi sisamo, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">eleda labe</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe. Auluso, Onesimusu e-mo, Filemonone balu dabalu mololo faibe ligiamo, ene wi ufulumodai iminiluale alolubiyo. Aubale. E fisaba daalugulu, e eleda male koleba alolubiyo. Auluso aga, Folo selesia, Onesimusumo keliso holobagafia labene, e-mo, ene wi ufulu amodai haiba iminilu koleba adefe. Aga e seale eleda labe.</char></note><verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />E-mo, ne yaguso, aga nahe e ga labea obegeba mebaisu. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Na hilisesiamo, e yagi nadai adesiabiaga, na henebaiyo. Enebamo, na awalu sulu nafulu walelumone, dibolo aso iwi labimo, ehe ge wi alibiasia, na sagoba ufiyone adesenaga, amo nafulu. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Na eweguba asigibuso, ga nadai aso amone eebale ligiamo, na auba moloyale. Maumo, na auba sagoba homaleba gafea egedidiba saeyo hamefale. Aubale. Ga gene asigifeguba kuliba abia, auba molomesi hamefe.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Seale, Onesimusu ehe ga afasia, gadai ligiale fogo alolu. Auluso, kegele ewe holobagalumone maumo, eweguba hilisesu. E aga obegeba milifasia, e-mo ge adesia, gadai kulifia alefalu miliyobafe. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:2">1Dim 6.2</ref></char></note> Samini e-mo, ge <char style="w">balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe</char> ligia, ga ene biso labi, e ge alolu. Auluso, e aga ge koleba labemo, mau no koleba. Aga e-mo, ge hameselu gelewo labe. Aulune, e samini ge alolumone waseba suniafia, aga e-mo, ge koleba labe. Nahe e-mo ne nelewolegulu hameseba lolu. Aulugulu, na hilisesia, gada, e-mo ge gelewolegulu hameseyobafe. Ga e hamesesiamo, na waseba suniaeyobafeba hilisesu. Na helefealufealo amosu selesuale. Aubale, Kelisofea alefasiamo, gahe e ge gelewole labeba bisigia, ga koleba e seale hameseyobafe.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Auba aulune, ga hilisesia, na gadai seale dafifia adoba hilisesenaga, amo gahe na uluba diloguba, Onesimusuda aubasu obegeba uluba dimale.<verse eid="PHM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Ehe gafea heleba mololunagada, e gafea sabe obegeba meyo aso adesenagada, nene na amone sabe duguba meyogulu, ga nafea saaba memale. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Na <char style="w">Folo</char>, nene sonehe na sulu ewe saaba ofelesia, seleba ofelesu. <char style="it">Ene dano amo, nene na duguba meyo. </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:19">Auluso, Filemono, ga ewe asigima. Nahe gafea Yesune awalu sulu nafulu walelualebiaga, ga aga miliyolu miliyo aso duluale alebaiyo. Aulune, ga nafea sabe obegeba meyo aso dobu. Ge miliyo ogomo nafea duguba sabe meyodolu besabe. Auluso, nahe ga auba memaleba selesuale. Aubale. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Auluso, nelewo, doma. Ga nafea huliane wedino meloguba, na gafea haalilumo molomaleyobile?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:20">Na gafea haalilumo ewe. Onesimusu heneba uluba dimale. Ga auba molosenaga, amo ga seale Saminilofea mesia auyobafe. Amosuale, ani Kelisodai kulifia ligia, auba molosenaga, gahe ne liboda nafuluba heneba heafuba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="PHM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Molomalu sulu ewe na gafea solumo dofasia, ga kuliba maiyobafeba, na fadaba asigibu. Amosuale, ga amo waseba, gegoaba mesia, Onesimusufea heafusia, heneba uluba diyobafe. Na auba asigisia, sowi ewe gafea seleba mesu.<verse eid="PHM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 1:25">Fil 1.25</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:24">2.24</ref></char>
    </note>Elosia, kegele no. Na <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hamemo eweguba diba ofogofia yasiba</char> lolu. Gili <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu solu</char> amofea alefasia, ilihe na sububa dafogomesine hame diba ofogofia yasiba lolu. Auba ausenaga, na gili labea haiba sobele miyobasu. Aulune, ge molo usu ugi, sobele haneyo molobu uleno ne-ba madeneba homale.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folone ua dabalu mololo ilihe Filemonofea hawiyoba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:7">Kol 1.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Efafalasehe gafea hawiyoba seleso. Eda dibolo iwi labene, ani anifaba Yesu Kelisone dibolo inolo lolu. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:10-14">Kol 4.10-14</ref></char></note><char style="w" lemma="Maga">Magada</char>, aufia Alisidakusuda, aufia Demaseda, aufia <char style="w" lemma="Lugu">Lugu</char> eda, ili iwi nadai ua dabalu mololo ligia, ilida gafea hawiyoba seleso.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Saminilo Yesu Kelisone <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululomo</char> gine asubanedai miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:25">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="EndOfBookOnobasulu_Epistles.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="1.25" /><verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>